# Self DM E2E Flow
> Message yourself and reopen your own DM from the DM list.

## User messages themselves and reopens the self DM from the DM list
* Using browser
* Ensuring user "user-3" is logged in
* Creating DM with user "user-3"
* generating net-new message details "message-self" with text "Note to self" in dm "dm-self" for user "user-3"
* Sending stored message "message-self" in dm "dm-self" for user "user-3"
* navigating via sidebar to "calls"
* Opening DM from user "user-3"
* Verifying stored message "message-self" in dm "dm-self" for user "user-3" is visible in current conversation
